00:28:32.920 --> 00:28:37.300
And then Pam said that if Roy wins, they're going to take the wave runners up to the lake.
然后帕姆说，如果罗伊赢了，他们周末就要去湖上玩水上摩托。

770
00:28:37.340 --> 00:28:38.140
