00:28:38.160 --> 00:28:40.120
And Jim says, well, I think Roy is going to be working.
吉姆就说，我觉得罗伊周末得加班。

772
00:28:40.280 --> 00:28:43.380
So I think you're going to be coming to the mall with me, you know, just if you want
所以我猜你会跟我一起去商场，你知道的，如果你想

